---
import { contactEmail } from '../config';
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
---

<Doc
  title="Contact"
  description="How to get in touch with SnoreHive: help with the app, your data, and press questions."
  eyebrow="Contact"
  lede="Write to us about the app, your data or the figures."
>
  <p class="contact__address">
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Help with the app:</strong> say which phone you use, and what happened.</li>
    <li><strong>Your data:</strong> to ask what we hold, or to have it deleted. You can also delete your account in the app's Settings.</li>
    <li><strong>Press:</strong> every figure we publish has its sample size and method, and we can look at questions we have not published yet.</li>
  </ul>
</Doc>

<style>
  .contact__address {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
